feat(load-testing): add k6 load-testing harness for the GIMS API

Isolated, read-only k6 suite; nothing under app/ is modified.

- Sanctum SPA auth (csrf-cookie -> login -> session check) with per-VU
  accounts, persistent sessions (noCookiesReset) and login-failure detection.
- Read workflow: dashboard, beneficiary list/search/details, active (batch)
  rows; per-endpoint duration/request/failure metrics.
- Profiles: smoke (1 VU), small (5), medium (10), target (20 users: 30 s
  ramp, 4 min hold, 30 s ramp down) with thresholds.
- Markdown + JSON report per run plus console summary.
- Windows helpers: portable k6 installer, runner (loads .env), stop script.
- Provisioning script for 20 dedicated loadtest* peso_manager accounts,
  gitignored credentials file, cleanup mode.
- README documents the inspected auth flow, endpoint mapping, rate limits,
  result interpretation, bottlenecks and safety rules.
